<title>UK: Tunisia tenders to sell five crude cargoes - trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia tenders to sell five crude cargoes - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia has tendered to sell five cargoes of crude oil in December and January, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender includes three cargoes of Zarzaitine loading on Dec 11-13, Dec 29-31 and Jan 11-16 and two cargoes of Ashtart loading on Dec 6-8 and Dec 28-Jan 1.</p>
<p>Bids must be received by Nov 13 and must be valid until Nov 15, they added.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
